me":"pb-4 pt-0 text-muted-foreground","children":"For Hajj, we recommend booking at least 8-12 months in advance as spots are limited by country quotas and fill up quickly. For Umrah, booking 2-3 months in advance is generally sufficient, though during peak seasons like Ramadan, we recommend booking 4-6 months ahead."}]}]]}],"$L1d","$L1e"]}]}]
